WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:14.078
Hi there!

2
00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:18.374
Who are you?

3
00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:21.383
I'm a clown fish.

4
00:00:21.384 --> 00:00:26.342
We are very colorful fish!

5
00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:28.758
Where do you live?

6
00:00:28.759 --> 00:00:32.760
Clown fish live in the ocean.

7
00:00:32.761 --> 00:00:35.904
We like warm water.

8
00:00:35.905 --> 00:00:40.768
We swim near rocks and reefs.

9
00:00:40.769 --> 00:00:43.371
What do you eat?

10
00:00:43.372 --> 00:00:46.942
Clown fish eat lots of plants.

11
00:00:46.943 --> 00:00:51.680
We also eat tiny animals.

12
00:00:51.681 --> 00:00:56.668
What's behind you?

13
00:00:56.669 --> 00:01:03.208
That's a sea anemone.

14
00:01:03.209 --> 00:01:06.390
Some fish are afraid of them.

15
00:01:06.391 --> 00:01:09.858
But I'm not!

16
00:01:09.859 --> 00:01:13.864
You like anemones?

17
00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:17.616
Yes. We help each other.

18
00:01:17.617 --> 00:01:21.454
Clown fish live with anemones.

19
00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:29.064
They protect us from enemies.

20
00:01:29.065 --> 00:01:32.704
How do clown fish help anemones?

21
00:01:32.705 --> 00:01:36.113
Clown fish clean anemones.

22
00:01:36.114 --> 00:01:39.709
We chase their enemies away.

23
00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:44.087
And we share our food.

24
00:01:44.088 --> 00:01:47.940
Do all clown fish look like you?

25
00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:52.603
No. Clown fish have different colors.

26
00:01:52.604 --> 00:01:55.401
Some have different patterns.

27
00:01:55.402 --> 00:02:03.566
Look. I have three white stripes!

28
00:02:03.567 --> 00:02:07.459
Oh no! The anemone needs help.

29
00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.822
Good-bye!

30
00:02:10.823 --> 00:02:16.047
Good-bye, Clown Fish!
